<title>USA: NetUSA knows no reason for stock activity.</title>
<headline>NetUSA knows no reason for stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>NetUSA Inc said Wednesday it knew of no reason for recent increasing trading activity in it stock.</p>
<p>NetUSA said company fundamentals remain unchanged.</p>
<p>It said a favorable recommendation on the stock had been issued over the Internet, but the recommendation contained no information that had not already been disclosed in regulatory filings.</p>
</text>
